     array['flowers', 'red', 'indoor', 'gift', 'luxury'], false),

    -- ------------------------------------------------------------- Fruit Trees
    ('Thai Guava (Peyara)', 'Psidium guajava', 'fruit-trees',
     'A grafted guava that fruits in a big pot within a year.',
     E'Large, crunchy, sweet fruit with few seeds. One of the most productive rooftop fruit trees.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Water deeply twice a week in summer\n- Bag young fruit to protect from fruit flies',
     450, 520, 26, 5, 'guava', 'full_sun', 'easy', 3, 60, true, false, true, 300,
     array['fruit', 'edible', 'grafted', 'rooftop', 'high-yield'], false),
    ('Kagzi Lebu (Lime)', 'Citrus × aurantiifolia', 'fruit-trees',
     'Thin-skinned, juicy limes for every meal — straight from your balcony.',
     E'A compact, thorny lime that fruits in flushes through the year. The blossoms smell wonderful.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Let the topsoil dry between waterings\n- Feed with a citrus fertiliser monthly\n\n**Good to know:** citrus is toxic to cats and dogs.',
     380, null, 35, 6, 'lime', 'full_sun', 'easy', 3, 30, false, false, true, 200,
     array['fruit', 'edible', 'citrus', 'kitchen'], false),
    ('Litchi (Bombai)', 'Litchi chinensis', 'fruit-trees',
     'A grafted Bombai litchi — sweet, juicy, and ready for a large drum.',
     E'Litchi needs patience and space, but a grafted plant can fruit in 3–4 years. Best for rooftops and gardens.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Water regularly; never let it dry out completely\n- Feed after harvest',
     850, 950, 12, 3, 'litchi', 'full_sun', 'moderate', 3, 60, false, false, true, 400,
     array['fruit', 'edible', 'grafted', 'summer'], false),
    ('Pomegranate (Dalim)', 'Punica granatum', 'fruit-trees',
     'Orange-red flowers followed by jewel-like fruit; very drought-tolerant.',
     E'Thrives in hot sun and dry spells. Flowers and fruit appear on the same branch, which makes it ornamental too.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Water deeply, then let it dry\n- Thin the fruit for bigger pomegranates',
     520, null, 20, 4, 'pomegranate', 'full_sun', 'easy', 4, 30, false, false, true, 250,
     array['fruit', 'edible', 'drought-tolerant', 'ornamental'], false),
    ('Dragon Fruit (Red Flesh)', 'Selenicereus undatus', 'fruit-trees',
     'A climbing cactus with spectacular night flowers and bright red fruit.',
     E'Hugely popular on Bangladeshi rooftops. Plant it against a post with a ring on top and it fruits in its second year.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Water weekly; less in winter\n- Hand-pollinate the night flowers for more fruit',
     480, 560, 28, 6, 'dragon-fruit', 'full_sun', 'easy', 7, 30, true, false, true, 200,
     array['fruit', 'edible', 'cactus', 'rooftop', 'trending'], true),
    ('Papaya (Red Lady)', 'Carica papaya', 'fruit-trees',
     'A dwarf hybrid papaya that fruits within 8–9 months.',
     E'One plant gives dozens of sweet, red-fleshed papayas. Grow it in a large tub with excellent drainage.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Water regularly but never waterlog\n- Feed monthly with compost',
     220, null, 40, 8, 'papaya', 'full_sun', 'easy', 2, 30, false, false, true, 300,
     array['fruit', 'edible', 'fast-growing', 'high-yield'], false),
    ('Sofeda (Sapodilla)', 'Manilkara zapota', 'fruit-trees',
     'Brown, caramel-sweet fruit from a tidy evergreen tree.',
     E'A grafted plant that fruits in a large drum. The fruit tastes of brown sugar and pear.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Water when the topsoil is dry\n- Feed twice a year',
     650, null, 13, 3, 'sapodilla', 'full_sun', 'moderate', 4, 60, false, false, true, 400,
     array['fruit', 'edible', 'grafted'], false),
    ('Jamrul (Wax Apple)', 'Syzygium samarangense', 'fruit-trees',
     'Crisp, bell-shaped fruit in pink and white; a summer treat.',
     E'A pretty tree with fluffy flowers followed by watery, refreshing fruit in summer.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Water generously while fruiting\n- Prune after harvest',
     550, null, 15, 4, 'wax-apple', 'full_sun', 'easy', 3, 60, false, false, true, 400,
     array['fruit', 'edible', 'summer'], false),
    ('Sagor Kola (Dwarf Banana)', 'Musa acuminata', 'fruit-trees',
     'A dwarf banana for a big tub; fruits in around a year.',
     E'Quick, leafy and tropical. Feed it heavily and keep it well watered for a full bunch.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Water often; bananas are thirsty\n- Feed every two weeks with compost or manure',
     350, null, 22, 5, 'banana', 'full_sun', 'easy', 2, 30, true, false, true, 250,
     array['fruit', 'edible', 'tropical', 'pet-safe'], false),
    ('Fig (Dumur)', 'Ficus carica', 'fruit-trees',
     'Sweet, jammy figs on a compact, pot-friendly tree.',
     E'Figs fruit well in containers and are surprisingly hardy. Pick them when they droop and feel soft.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Water when the topsoil is dry\n- Prune in winter to keep it compact\n\n**Good to know:** the sap can irritate skin and is toxic to pets.',
     750, null, 0, 3, 'fig', 'full_sun', 'moderate', 3, 30, false, false, true, 200,
     array['fruit', 'edible', 'pot-friendly'], false),

