    ('Brinjal (Begun)', 'Solanum melongena', 'vegetables',
     'Glossy purple brinjal from a pot on your balcony.',
     E'A staple of every Bangladeshi kitchen. Stake the plant once fruit sets to support the weight.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Water every other day in summer\n- Feed every two weeks once flowers appear',
