     array['vegetable', 'edible', 'climber', 'summer'], false),
    ('Shosha (Cucumber)', 'Cucumis sativus', 'vegetables',
     'Crisp salad cucumbers from a grow bag and a simple trellis.',
     E'Cucumbers grow fast and love warmth. Keep the soil moist for sweet, non-bitter fruit.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Water daily in summer\n- Harvest at 15–20 cm',
