     array['vegetable', 'edible', 'salad', 'climber', 'pet-safe'], false),
    ('Fulkopi (Cauliflower)', 'Brassica oleracea var. botrytis', 'vegetables',
     'Winter cauliflower seedlings, ready to plant in October–November.',
     E'A tray of six healthy seedlings. Grow in full sun with rich soil for tight, white curds by January.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Keep the soil evenly moist\n- Tie the outer leaves over the curd to keep it white',
