    ('Tulsi (Holy Basil)', 'Ocimum tenuiflorum', 'herbs-greens',
     'Fragrant holy basil for tea, prayer and the courtyard.',
     E'A sacred and medicinal herb in many Bangladeshi homes. Pinch the flower spikes to keep the leaves coming.\n\n**Care tips**\n- Full sun\n- Water when the topsoil is dry\n- Pinch tips regularly for a bushy plant',
